  "2994cc50-de81-4a7b-a991-058c7fd680d4"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the options a causal substrate is drawn with at a given size"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"c4d326f2-8332-418d-83a3-888411e5dfc4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
